                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbf813ba-b287-4119-b365-6bfa083a7256",
                                                "sense_id": "780f253b-78b6-3ce6-bfb1-7429fba04007",
                                                "text": "By and by the steamboat intruded. Then for fifteen or twenty years, these men continued to run their keelboats down-stream, and the steamers did all of the upstream business, the keelboatmen selling their boats in New Orleans, and returning home as deck passengers in the steamers."
